OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers to vote on 'leaving UK'
OL,4,Aover plans to house migrants at RAF
OL,5,Abase
OL,6,
OL,7,FVillagers will head to the polls on
OL,8,FSaturday to decide whether or not to
OL,9,Fsymbolically leave the UK over plans to
OL,10,Fhouse migrants at a former military
OL,11,Fbase.
OL,13,FRAF Barnham, between Bury St Edmunds,
OL,14,FSuffolk, and Thetford, Norfolk, has
OL,15,Fbeen earmarked by the government as a
OL,16,Fpotential base for up to 931 migrants.
OL,18,FThe proposals have not gone down well
OL,19,Fwith locals and far-right groups alike,
OL,20,Fsparking several anti-asylum
OL,21,Fdemonstrations since the summer.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
