OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers to vote on 'leaving UK'
OL,4,Aover plans to house migrants at RAF
OL,5,Abase
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne way or another, residents are now
OL,8,Fpoised to make their voices heard by
OL,9,Ftaking part in a referendum to decide
OL,10,Fwhether to symbolically secede from the
OL,11,Fcountry or remain.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
